# Design reference only — never build input (see design-mockups/README.md).
# Large, churny binaries stay out of history; .gitkeep and README.md are not
# images, so they are not matched here and keep the directory on a fresh clone.
design-mockups/*.png
design-mockups/*.jpg
design-mockups/*.webp

